Z||000000||ordovician||12-24-2001||06:11 PM||||could someone show me a pic of the exhaust system on a duke?<BR> i cannot see a muffler on my car, just this little miniature muffler looking thing that has a hole in it (a hole thats supposed to be there from the looks of it). is this the cat? why the hole? and where is the muffler?||||reg||1
Z||000001||x-thumpr-x||12-24-2001||07:43 PM||||your muffler is directly behind the trunk . Look below your intake manifold and towards the back, you should see it. Just a dinky little thing. You cat is located below your exhaust manifold at the front of the engine cradle. If it is stock, there will be three plugs on the bottom of it. If you're missing a plug, better replace the cat. you'll find the car's exhaust will be little more quiet after  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> (been there done that)||||reg||1
